{"id": "puxian_xingyuan", "type": "Text", "title": "大方广佛华严经普贤菩萨行愿品", "title_zh": "大方广佛华严经普贤菩萨行愿品", "translator": "般若", "category": "華嚴部类", "volume": "", "juan_count": 40, "actual_char_count": 727, "canon_ref": "T.293", "taisho": "T0293", "vehicle": "大乘", "mode": "显教", "translation_place": "", "time_from": 795, "belongs_to_school": ["华严宗"], "parallel_translations": [], "kepan": {"序分": [], "正宗分": ["c000", "c001"], "流通分": []}, "chapters": [{"id": "c000", "chapter_no": 1, "chapter_title": "十大愿王", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00000"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": ["p001", "p102"], "doctrines": [], "char_count": 164}, {"id": "c001", "chapter_no": 2, "chapter_title": "偈颂·节选", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00001", "p00002", "p00003", "p00004", "p00005", "p00006", "p00007", "p00008", "p00009", "p00010", "p00011", "p00012", "p00013", "p00014", "p00015", "p00016", "p00017", "p00018"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": ["c001", "c008"], "char_count": 546}], "paragraphs": [{"id": "p00000", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "尔时，普贤菩萨摩诃萨称叹如来胜功德已，告诸菩萨及善财言：\"善男子，如来功德，假使十方一切诸佛经不可说不可说佛刹极微尘数劫，相续演说不可穷尽。若欲成就此功德门，应", "char_count": 164, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001", "p102"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00001", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "所有十方世界中，三世一切人师子，我以清净身语意，一切遍礼尽无余。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00002", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 2, "text_preview": "普贤行愿威神力，普现一切如来前，一身复现刹尘身，一一遍礼刹尘佛。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00003", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 3, "text_preview": "于一尘中尘数佛，各处菩萨众会中，无尽法界尘亦然，深信诸佛皆充满。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c001"]}, {"id": "p00004", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 4, "text_preview": "各以一切音声海，普出无尽妙言辞，尽于未来一切劫，赞佛甚深功德海。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00005", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 5, "text_preview": "以诸最胜妙华鬘，伎乐涂香及伞盖，如是最胜庄严具，我以供养诸如来。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00006", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 6, "text_preview": "最胜衣服最胜香，末香烧香与灯烛，一一皆如妙高聚，我悉供养诸如来。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00007", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 7, "text_preview": "我以广大胜解心，深信一切三世佛，悉以普贤行愿力，普遍供养诸如来。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00008", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 8, "text_preview": "我昔所造诸恶业，皆由无始贪瞋痴，从身语意之所生，一切我今皆忏悔。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00009", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 9, "text_preview": "十方一切诸众生，二乘有学及无学，一切如来与菩萨，所有功德皆随喜。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00010", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 10, "text_preview": "十方所有世间灯，最初成就菩提者，我今一切皆劝请，转于无上妙法轮。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00011", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 11, "text_preview": "诸佛若欲示涅槃，我悉至诚而劝请，唯愿久住刹尘劫，利乐一切诸众生。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c008"]}, {"id": "p00012", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 12, "text_preview": "所有礼赞供养福，请佛住世转法轮，随喜忏悔诸善根，回向众生及佛道。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00013", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 13, "text_preview": "……", "char_count": 2, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00014", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 14, "text_preview": "愿我临欲命终时，尽除一切诸障碍，面见彼佛阿弥陀，即得往生安乐刹。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00015", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 15, "text_preview": "我既往生彼国已，现前成就此大愿，一切圆满尽无余，利乐一切众生界。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00016", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 16, "text_preview": "彼佛众会咸清净，我时于胜莲华生，亲睹如来无量光，现前授我菩提记。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00017", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 17, "text_preview": "蒙彼如来授记已，化身无数百俱胝，智力广大遍十方，普利一切众生界。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00018", "chapter_id": "c001", "para_no": 18, "text_preview": "乃至虚空世界尽，众生及业烦恼尽，如是一切无尽时，我愿究竟恒无尽。", "char_count": 32, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figure_mentions": [{"figure_id": "p001", "name": "释迦牟尼佛", "chapters": ["c000", "c001"], "mention_count": 2}, {"figure_id": "p102", "name": "普贤菩萨", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "doctrine_mentions": [{"concept_id": "c001", "name": "法界", "chapters": ["c001"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c008", "name": "涅槃", "chapters": ["c001"], "mention_count": 1}], "translator_note": "译事未入大事年表", "transmission_events": ["event:translation:般若"]}